zh:
右端的因子$\gamma$并不是额外的力。由于 $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$ 它从[eq:x-force]的两端消去。因此精确的空间方程仍然是 $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ 熟悉的形式保留了下来，但相对论性隐藏在动量之中。

es:
El factor $\gamma$ del lado derecho no es una fuerza adicional. Puesto que $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$, se cancela en ambos lados de [eq:x-force]. Por tanto, la ecuación espacial exacta vuelve a ser $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ Se conserva la forma conocida, pero la relatividad está contenida en el momento.

de:
Der Faktor $\gamma$ auf der rechten Seite ist keine zusätzliche Kraft. Da $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$, kürzt er sich auf beiden Seiten von [eq:x-force] heraus. Die exakte räumliche Gleichung lautet daher wieder $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ Die vertraute Form bleibt erhalten, aber die Relativität steckt im Impuls.

zh-Hant:
右側的$\gamma$因子不是額外的力。由於 $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$ 它會從[eq:x-force]的兩側約去。因此，精確的空間方程仍然是 $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ 熟悉的形式保留下來，相對論效應則包含在動量之中。

ko:
우변의 인자 $\gamma$는 별도의 힘이 아닙니다. $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$이므로 이 인자는 [eq:x-force]의 양변에서 소거됩니다. 따라서 정확한 공간 방정식은 다시 다음과 같습니다. $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ 익숙한 형태는 유지되지만, 상대론적 효과는 운동량에 반영되어 있습니다.

vi:
Thừa số $\gamma$ ở vế phải không phải là một lực bổ sung. Vì $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$ nên nó triệt tiêu ở cả hai vế của [eq:x-force]. Do đó phương trình không gian chính xác lại là $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ Dạng quen thuộc vẫn còn đó, nhưng tính tương đối được ẩn trong động lượng.

ru:
Множитель $\gamma$ справа — не дополнительная сила. Поскольку $\frac{dp^i}{d\tau}=\frac{dt}{d\tau}\frac{dp^i}{dt}
  =\gamma\frac{dp^i}{dt},$ он сокращается в обеих частях [eq:x-force]. Поэтому точное пространственное уравнение снова имеет вид $\frac{d\boldsymbol p}{dt}
  =q\bigl(\boldsymbol E+\boldsymbol v\times\boldsymbol B\bigr),
  \qquad
  \boldsymbol p=m\gamma\boldsymbol v.$ Привычная форма сохраняется, но релятивистский характер скрыт в импульсе.

p.src:
The simplest wave equations contain two derivatives. If the equation is to have the same form in every inertial frame, its left-hand side should be a scalar. Contracting the derivative indices gives the unique simplest choice: $\boxed{\partial^\mu\partial_\mu\phi=0.}$ Writing out the components in the present signature, $\frac{\partial^2\phi}{\partial t^2}
  -\frac{\partial^2\phi}{\partial x^2}
  -\frac{\partial^2\phi}{\partial y^2}
  -\frac{\partial^2\phi}{\partial z^2}=0.$ The contraction in [eq:wave-covariant] makes Lorentz invariance manifest; equation [eq:wave-components] is the same statement written component by component.

